    "note": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "game.butu_srf.p0036",
    "source_encoding": "game_font12_16_combat_skip",
    "output_encoding": "",
    "reference": "フム、モラオウカ。",
    "translation": "",
    "note": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "game.butu_srf.p0037",
    "source_encoding": "game_font12_16_combat_skip",
    "output_encoding": "",
    "reference": "ソレ、モラウゾ。",
    "translation": "",
    "note": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "game.butu_srf.p0038",
    "source_encoding": "game_font12_16_combat_skip",
    "output_encoding": "",
    "reference": "特に要り用の物ではないが、{n}収めておくことにするぞえ。",
    "translation": "",
    "note": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "game.butu_srf.p0039",
    "source_encoding": "game_font12_16_combat_skip",
    "output_encoding": "",
    "reference": "貴殿からの贈り物、{n}有難く、頂くことにしよう。",
    "translation": "",
    "note": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "game.butu_srf.p0040",
    "source_encoding": "game_font12_16_combat_skip",
    "output_encoding": "",
    "reference": "今回は、これで我慢してあげますわ。",
    "translation": "",
    "note": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "game.butu_srf.p0041",
    "source_encoding": "game_font12_16_combat_skip",
    "output_encoding": "",
    "reference": "それ、俺にくれるのか？{n}まあ、もらっといてやるよ。",
    "translation": "",
    "note": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "game.butu_srf.p0042",
    "source_encoding": "game_font12_16_combat_skip",
    "output_encoding": "",
    "reference": "ちょっとぉ、他に何かないわけ？{n}まあ、仕方ないわね、もらってあげるわ。",
    "translation": "",
    "note": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "game.butu_srf.p0043",
    "source_encoding": "game_font12_16_combat_skip",
    "output_encoding": "",
    "reference": "ありがとう、おじさん。{n}子供は素直に受け取らなきゃね。",
    "translation": "",
    "note": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "game.butu_srf.p0044",
    "source_encoding": "game_font12_16_combat_skip",
    "output_encoding": "",
    "reference": "あたし、つまんなくても、物って大好き。{n}おじちゃん、ありがとね。",
    "translation": "",
    "note": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "game.butu_srf.p0045",
    "source_encoding": "game_font12_16_combat_skip",
    "output_encoding": "",
    "reference": "まあ、嬉しい。{n}次はもっと、いいものくれるんでしょう？",
    "translation": "",
    "note": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "game.butu_srf.p0046",
    "source_encoding": "game_font12_16_combat_skip",
    "output_encoding": "",
    "reference": "そんなの要らねえよ。{n}もっとくれ。",
    "translation": "",
    "note": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "game.butu_srf.p0047",
    "source_encoding": "game_font12_16_combat_skip",
    "output_encoding": "",
    "reference": "豊かなことは、ええことじゃのう。{n}頂くぞい。",
    "translation": "",
    "note": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "game.butu_srf.p0048",
    "source_encoding": "game_font12_16_combat_skip",
    "output_encoding": "",
    "reference": "どうしてもと言うのでしたら、{n}仕方ない、引き取ってあげましょう。",
    "translation": "",
    "note": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "game.butu_srf.p0049",
    "source_encoding": "game_font12_16_combat_skip",
    "output_encoding": "",
    "reference": "まぁそんぐらいで、まけといたろか。{n}おおきに。",
    "translation": "",
    "note": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "game.butu_srf.p0050",
    "source_encoding": "game_font12_16_combat_skip",
    "output_encoding": "",
    "reference": "ピチャッピチャッ、{n}ズズー・・・。",
    "translation": "",
    "note": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "game.butu_srf.p0051",
    "source_encoding": "game_font12_16_combat_skip",
    "output_encoding": "",
    "reference": "・・・・・・・・。",
    "translation": "",
    "note": ""
  },
