    "translation": "",
    "note": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "game.butu_srf.p0071",
    "source_encoding": "game_font12_16_combat_skip",
    "output_encoding": "",
    "reference": "",
    "translation": "",
    "note": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "game.butu_srf.p0072",
    "source_encoding": "game_font12_16_combat_skip",
    "output_encoding": "",
    "reference": "ツネヅネ、嬉シイコトヲ、シテクレル。{n}人間ニ、シテオクニハ、モッタイナイナ。",
    "translation": "",
    "note": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "game.butu_srf.p0073",
    "source_encoding": "game_font12_16_combat_skip",
    "output_encoding": "",
    "reference": "オレ、ウレシイ。スゴク、ウレシイ。{n}コンゴトモ、ヨロシク。",
    "translation": "",
    "note": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "game.butu_srf.p0074",
    "source_encoding": "game_font12_16_combat_skip",
    "output_encoding": "",
    "reference": "我らのきずな、{n}より堅固に結ばれていく。",
    "translation": "",
    "note": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "game.butu_srf.p0075",
    "source_encoding": "game_font12_16_combat_skip",
    "output_encoding": "",
    "reference": "貴殿に忠誠を誓う時も、{n}そう遠くはないだろう。",
    "translation": "",
    "note": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "game.butu_srf.p0076",
    "source_encoding": "game_font12_16_combat_skip",
    "output_encoding": "",
    "reference": "そんなに私のことが気になりますの？{n}今夜、つきあってあげてもよくってよ。",
    "translation": "",
    "note": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "game.butu_srf.p0077",
    "source_encoding": "game_font12_16_combat_skip",
    "output_encoding": "",
    "reference": "忠誠度アーップ！{n}＞俺の気持ちが上がった。",
    "translation": "",
    "note": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "game.butu_srf.p0078",
    "source_encoding": "game_font12_16_combat_skip",
    "output_encoding": "",
    "reference": "あたし・・・、いつかきっと、{n}あなたのモノになったげる。",
    "translation": "",
    "note": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "game.butu_srf.p0079",
    "source_encoding": "game_font12_16_combat_skip",
    "output_encoding": "",
    "reference": "へえ、ボクの欲しい物よくわかるね。{n}おじさん、いいとこあるじゃん。",
    "translation": "",
    "note": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "game.butu_srf.p0080",
    "source_encoding": "game_font12_16_combat_skip",
    "output_encoding": "",
    "reference": "ねぇ、おじちゃんって、{n}なんでこんなに優しいの。アリガトウ。",
    "translation": "",
    "note": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "game.butu_srf.p0081",
    "source_encoding": "game_font12_16_combat_skip",
    "output_encoding": "",
    "reference": "あら素敵！プレゼントって、{n}幾つになっても、嬉しいものなのよね。",
    "translation": "",
    "note": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "game.butu_srf.p0082",
    "source_encoding": "game_font12_16_combat_skip",
    "output_encoding": "",
    "reference": "ふざけんじゃねえぞ、コラ！{n}スゲエ、嬉しいじゃねえか。",
    "translation": "",
    "note": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "game.butu_srf.p0083",
    "source_encoding": "game_font12_16_combat_skip",
    "output_encoding": "",
    "reference": "先の短い年寄りには、もったいないのう。{n}いつも感謝してるぞい。",
    "translation": "",
    "note": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "game.butu_srf.p0084",
    "source_encoding": "game_font12_16_combat_skip",
    "output_encoding": "",
    "reference": "物欲を利用しようというのですか・・・。{n}・・・なるほどね。",
    "translation": "",
    "note": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "game.butu_srf.p0085",
    "source_encoding": "game_font12_16_combat_skip",
    "output_encoding": "",
    "reference": "やったー、おおきに、ありがとう。{n}ごっつ嬉しいなぁ。",
    "translation": "",
    "note": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "game.butu_srf.p0086",
    "source_encoding": "game_font12_16_combat_skip",
    "output_encoding": "",
    "reference": "ズーズーズー！{n}ズーズズー！",
    "translation": "",
    "note": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "game.butu_srf.p0087",
    "source_encoding": "game_font12_16_combat_skip",
    "output_encoding": "",
    "reference": "・・・・・・・・。",
    "translation": "",
    "note": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "game.butu_srf.p0088",
    "source_encoding": "game_font12_16_combat_skip",
