    "reference": "",
    "translation": "",
    "note": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "game.butu_srf.p0107",
    "source_encoding": "game_font12_16_combat_skip",
    "output_encoding": "",
    "reference": "",
    "translation": "",
    "note": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "game.butu_srf.p0108",
    "source_encoding": "game_font12_16_combat_skip",
    "output_encoding": "",
    "reference": "長イ、ツキアイニ、ナリソウダナ。",
    "translation": "",
    "note": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "game.butu_srf.p0109",
    "source_encoding": "game_font12_16_combat_skip",
    "output_encoding": "",
    "reference": "キサマ、ヨクシテクレル。{n}ダカラ、オレサマ、カワル。",
    "translation": "",
    "note": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "game.butu_srf.p0110",
    "source_encoding": "game_font12_16_combat_skip",
    "output_encoding": "",
    "reference": "年々歳々花相似、歳々年々人不同・・・。{n}然し、我は永遠の忠誠を誓うなり。",
    "translation": "",
    "note": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "game.butu_srf.p0111",
    "source_encoding": "game_font12_16_combat_skip",
    "output_encoding": "",
    "reference": "貴殿と出会えたことを、感謝する。{n}感謝だけでは足りんかもな・・・。",
    "translation": "",
    "note": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "game.butu_srf.p0112",
    "source_encoding": "game_font12_16_combat_skip",
    "output_encoding": "",
    "reference": "今までつくしてくれたお礼をしたいわ。",
    "translation": "",
    "note": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "game.butu_srf.p0113",
    "source_encoding": "game_font12_16_combat_skip",
    "output_encoding": "",
    "reference": "俺も恩義を知らないわけじゃねぇからな。{n}いいぜ、業魔殿に連れていけよ。",
    "translation": "",
    "note": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "game.butu_srf.p0114",
    "source_encoding": "game_font12_16_combat_skip",
    "output_encoding": "",
    "reference": "ここまでされちゃ、アタシだって・・・、{n}私を業魔殿へ連れてって！",
    "translation": "",
    "note": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "game.butu_srf.p0115",
    "source_encoding": "game_font12_16_combat_skip",
    "output_encoding": "",
    "reference": "今度から、おじさんのこと、{n}お兄さんって呼ぶよ。いいだろ・・・。",
    "translation": "",
    "note": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "game.butu_srf.p0116",
    "source_encoding": "game_font12_16_combat_skip",
    "output_encoding": "",
    "reference": "おじちゃん、あたしがいないと困る？{n}いつも、いっしょにいてあげるね。",
    "translation": "",
    "note": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "game.butu_srf.p0117",
    "source_encoding": "game_font12_16_combat_skip",
    "output_encoding": "",
    "reference": "あなたの気持ちだけで十分なのに・・・。{n}アタシ、いつもあなたの側にいたい・・・。",
    "translation": "",
    "note": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "game.butu_srf.p0118",
    "source_encoding": "game_font12_16_combat_skip",
    "output_encoding": "",
    "reference": "オレとおまえは、ウッキーだ。{n}これからも、よきウッキーでいよう。",
    "translation": "",
    "note": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "game.butu_srf.p0119",
    "source_encoding": "game_font12_16_combat_skip",
    "output_encoding": "",
    "reference": "わしのような老いぼれでよければ、{n}今後もお世話になろうかの、ほっほっほ。",
    "translation": "",
    "note": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "game.butu_srf.p0120",
    "source_encoding": "game_font12_16_combat_skip",
    "output_encoding": "",
    "reference": "よくここまで俺の関心をひいたな。{n}ま、お約束だ。いいぜ、好きにしろよ。",
    "translation": "",
    "note": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "game.butu_srf.p0121",
    "source_encoding": "game_font12_16_combat_skip",
    "output_encoding": "",
    "reference": "いろいろ世話になったから、{n}このぐらいでなんか、お返しせんとなぁ。",
    "translation": "",
    "note": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "game.butu_srf.p0122",
    "source_encoding": "game_font12_16_combat_skip",
    "output_encoding": "",
    "reference": "ズズーッピチャッ！！！{n}ズズズーーッ！！！",
    "translation": "",
    "note": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "game.butu_srf.p0123",
    "source_encoding": "game_font12_16_combat_skip",
    "output_encoding": "",
    "reference": "・・・・・・・・。",
    "translation": "",
    "note": ""
  },
